content:
The datasheet describes a single part (**SO-SFP-8GFC-SD**) with three interface standards listed together, FC rates and GbE called out separately, and no per-row application table. Modes below use only clear pairings: **1000BASE-LX** with **GbE** at **1.0 Gbps**; **400-M5E-SN-I** with **4G FC** at **4.0 Gbps** (400 in the standard name); **800-M5E-SN-I** with **8G FC** at **8.5 Gbps** (800 in the name and the receiver note at 8.5 Gbps). No penalties appear in the source. Other bit rates in the pool are not tied to a specific interface standard in the document, so they are not assigned to modes.

